targets, factors

# transcribed for pylfit from
# Mendoza, L. & Xenarios, I. "A method for the generation of standardized qualitative dynamical systems of regulatory networks." Theoretical Biology and Medical Modelling 3 (2006): 13. https://doi.org/10.1186/1742-4682-3-13
#
# The discrete system of the paper's Equation 2, with one difference:
# IL12R reads IL12 & !STAT6, where Equation 2 prints IL12 alone. The
# paper's text has STAT6 down-regulate IL-12R and its Table 7 counts
# four feedback circuits through that inhibition; with it, this file
# has the paper's 27 circuits (24 positive, 3 negative), without it 23.
# The four inputs (IFNb, IL12, IL18, TCR) are constant 0, as in the
# paper. Its three steady states (Th0, Th1, Th2, Table 1) are fixed
# points here.

TCR, 0
NFAT, (TCR)
IFNb, 0
IFNbR, (IFNb)
IL18, 0
IL18R, (IL18 & !STAT6)
IRAK, (IL18R)
SOCS1, (Tbet) | (STAT1)
IL12, 0
IL12R, (IL12 & !STAT6)
STAT4, (IL12R & !GATA3)
Tbet, (Tbet & !GATA3) | (STAT1 & !GATA3)
IFNg, (NFAT & !STAT3) | (IRAK & !STAT3) | (STAT4 & !STAT3) | (Tbet & !STAT3)
IFNgR, (IFNg)
JAK1, (IFNgR & !SOCS1)
STAT1, (IFNbR) | (JAK1)
IL4, (GATA3 & !STAT1)
IL4R, (IL4 & !SOCS1)
STAT6, (IL4R)
GATA3, (STAT6 & !Tbet) | (GATA3 & !Tbet)
IL10, (GATA3)
IL10R, (IL10)
STAT3, (IL10R)
